# 49. Vertical Slice Strategy

AEGIS should not be developed purely horizontally.

Avoid:

```text
Build all frontend
 ↓
Build all backend
 ↓
Connect everything
```

Instead use vertical slices.

Example:

```text
ONE OPERATIONAL CAPABILITY

UI
 ↓
State
 ↓
API
 ↓
Domain
 ↓
Database
 ↓
Events
 ↓
Tests
```

Then move to the next capability.

---

# 50. Why Vertical Slices Matter

This exposes architectural problems early.

If you build the entire frontend before testing the backend contract, you can spend weeks generating interfaces around an incorrect data model.

Vertical slices prevent that.

